kamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3W80X7HG0VENBZD4KQ0J6D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3W81ZZTNSBJJSGP7G09GVF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3W832NXF4K5QSSE6R4ZMMX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n 今年もひなくりに来てくださったおひさまのみなさん、そして配信を見てくださったおひさまのみなさん、素敵な祝花もありがとうございました😌\n \n \n \n 2年ぶりのおひさまとひなくりを過ごすことができ、幸せいっぱいでした！！\n \n \n \n とっても楽しかったよ〜。\n \n \n \n \n ソリッコ乗って、たくさんおひさまのお顔を見ることが出来ました😊\n \n \n \n \n \n 素敵な虹のプレゼント🎁もありがとうございました😌\n \n \n \n \n \n \n おひさま、大好き〜！！\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n     ﾟ+o｡◈｡o+ﾟ+o｡◈｡o+ﾟ+o｡◈｡o+ﾟ+o｡◈｡o+\n \n \n \n \n \n 今日の夜Melodix年末SPさんに出演させて頂きます！\n \n 今回はなんとアディショナルタイム⏰を披露させて頂きます。地上波では初めてになります👀\n \n \n 是非見てくださいねー😊\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 🍞佐々木美玲🍞"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-6312":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて読んでくださった方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントしてくださった方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はーい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこ？の企画で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"各地方でPRするため、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん、かずみ、えりか、私は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"徳島に飛んでましたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/03/0296949/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオや生放送の番組にも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出させていただきました><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張した><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type